          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Discarded by the guard",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Series a scrape brought that the scrape cache did not already hold. Sustained and large is unbounded growth, which is the failure this row exists to catch early. Small and intermittent is not: a label combination that appears occasionally — a rare status code — is evicted from the cache and counted again when it returns, so a well-behaved service draws a low sawtooth rather than a flat zero. Read this beside Samples per scrape, which is flat when nothing is really growing.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
